            "startLine": 21826,
            "endLine": 21842
          },
          "quotation": "9.7.13.2. Control Flow Instructions: @\n@{!}p    instruction;\nExecute an instruction or instruction block for threads that have the guard predicate True. Threads with a False guard predicate do nothing.\n\nIf {!}p then instruction"
        }
